usage: evaluate.py [-h] (--input INPUT | --manifest MANIFEST)
                   [--profile {strict600,overflow601}] [--data-root DATA_ROOT]
                   [--use-original-inputs] [--energy-key ENERGY_KEY]
                   [--energy-unit {keV,MeV}] [--dataset DATASET] --output
                   OUTPUT

Evaluate standardized event archives with explicit frozen paper profiles.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --input INPUT
  --manifest MANIFEST
  --profile {strict600,overflow601}
  --data-root DATA_ROOT
  --use-original-inputs
                        Read original paths from the local provenance
                        manifest; no source files are written
  --energy-key ENERGY_KEY
  --energy-unit {keV,MeV}
  --dataset DATASET     Filter manifest by exact dataset name; may be repeated
  --output OUTPUT
